			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"小五"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111120301,
					"content": "嗯，這樣應該就夠了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120302,
					"content": "那我就去準備香嫩椒椒雞了，你們應該還要去找其他人吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120303,
					"content": "等他們都準備好了，我也會把菜交給你們的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120304,
					"content": "好，知道了，那等會見！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120305,
					"content": "（咦？他是怎麼知道的？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1111204,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1111204
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1111204",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1111204,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"木木"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111120401,
					"content": "又是你們，唉，我說了對往生堂的生意沒有興趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120402,
					"content": "這次我們是被老孟介紹來的，你們是好朋友吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120403,
					"content": "嗯，這倒是，說起來，他最近好像是加入了往生堂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120404,
					"content": "這裡面的原因，我們這些童年好友都能猜到八九不離十——還是因為狼哥的事吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120405,
					"content": "但我知道勸他是沒用的，放下過去是一個特別痛苦的歷程，我也曾經經歷過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120406,
					"content": "所以，你們是因為狼哥的事來找我的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120407,
					"content": "好敏銳！明明什麼都還沒說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120408,
					"content": "哈哈，因為我也是生意人嘛，要保持對訊息的敏感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120409,
					"content": "大家都管我叫木木，說我反應很慢，剛開始做生意的時候因為這個也吃了不少虧，但…總歸是練出來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120410,
					"content": "這個就交給你們吧，這是我們小時候每人都夢想的豪華玩具箱，但那時候我們都沒什麼錢，根本買不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120411,
					"content": "現在我的生意發展得不錯，這樣的箱子我買了幾十個，也算是圓了以前的一個夢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120412,
					"content": "哇，這就是有錢人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120413,
					"content": "哈哈，因為對我來說，這也是對童年那段回憶的紀念，有了它，才有了今天的我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120414,
					"content": "對了，既然你們來找了我，應該還要去找小五和聰子吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120415,
					"content": "嗯嗯，之前已經見過小五了，現在要去找聰子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120416,
					"content": "哦哦，聰子的話，我們約好等會在緋雲坡的空中通道見面，就在通往碼頭的階梯的上方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120417,
					"content": "我還有點小事要處理，處理完了就會過去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1111205,
