			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111120801,
					"content": "辛苦你們了，品質果然非常不錯，那請稍等，只剩下最後的一步了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聰子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120802,
					"content": "好了，這樣應該就沒問題了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聰子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120803,
					"content": "我在霄燈裡面寫上了我們五個人的名字，其實每一年海燈節的時候，我們都會放一盞這樣的燈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聰子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120804,
					"content": "不管今後的日子變成什麼樣，我們走上了什麼不同的路，只要這個習慣還在，我們就沒有變。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聰子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120805,
					"content": "至於狼哥的事，我們三個已經商量好，不會過問的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120806,
					"content": "但希望你們如果有機會的話，麻煩轉告一下，我們一切都好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120807,
					"content": "而且，曾經說過的話，我們都已經實現了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120808,
						111120809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120808,
					"content": "放心吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111120810,
					"content": "謝謝你們，我們會轉達的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120811,
					"content": "有你們這樣的朋友，狼哥一定會很感動的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120809,
					"content": "「曾經說過的話」我也不會過問。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120810
					]
				}
			]
		},
